<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P assigns BBB rating to Advanced Service.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P assigns BBB rating to Advanced Service.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Friday it assigned a BBB long-term foreign currency rating to Thailand-based mobile phone company Advanced Service Public Co Ltd (AIS).  </p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflects the solid business base in Thailand for mobile phones, AIS's position within the mobile phone industry, and the company's strong balance sheet and financial profile.</p>
<p>The ratings agency said the outlook is stable.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
